{"id": "Dewy9AnxFgg", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why does everyone fear Shani Dev? 🪐 A devotee painted the 8 faces he shows to those who love him. Which one do YOU need right now?\n\n🖌️ These eight paintings are by @gaurav_boii, a follower of this page. Go show him some love 🙏\n\n1. Dandadhikari: Shanaishchara, \"the slow one\". Saturn spends about 2½ years in each sign, so his Sade Sati lasts 7½ years.\n2. Nyayadhish: Karmaphal Data, the giver of karma's fruit. No bribe, no favourite. Only your deeds.\n3. Chhaya: his mother Chhaya was the shadow Sanjna left in her place (Markandeya Purana). Like a shadow, karma follows you.\n4. Tapasvi: so lost in prayer to Krishna that he ignored his wife. Her curse gave him his feared gaze (Brahma Vaivarta Purana).\n5. Bal Shani: he promised sage Pippalada that no child under 16 will suffer by him (Shiva Purana).\n6. Yoddha: bow, arrow and trishul, a warrior for those who walk straight.\n7. Saumya: King Dasharatha praised him, and Shani blessed him and all who recite that stotra (Padma Purana).\n8. Raj Shani: strong in your chart, he gives Shasha Yoga, a fortune built to last.\n\nॐ शं शनैश्चराय नमः 🙏\n\n📚 Want stories like this for your family? Our Navadurga books 1–3 are ₹350 for the set (15K Family Deal, till 25 Oct midnight). Comment FAMILY and we'll DM you, or tap the link in bio: rishikatha.com\n\n💬 Comment JAI SHANI DEV and tell us which face you need right now.\n🔖 Save this for Saturday. Share it with someone in Sade Sati.\n\n#ShaniDev #Shani #ShaniMaharaj #Shanidham #SadeSati #Shanivar #Navagraha #HinduMythology #SanatanDharma #HinduGods #IndianArt #DevotionalArt #Jyotish #RishiKatha #Karma", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792598890, "like_count": 2695, "comment_count": 66, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28702467432748456a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 79.4, "asr": 48000, "format